### POST REQUEST : new character in the game
POST http://localhost:2000/game/characters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Goku",
  "team": "Saiyan",
  "powerLevel": 200000,
  "attackType": "SPECIAL"
}

### PUT REQUEST: change type of attack
@id = variable value
PUT http://localhost:2000/game/characters/2/attack-type
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attackType": "MAGIC"
}

### GET REQUEST : Attack of a character
GET http://localhost:2000/game/characters/3/attack

### POST REQUEST: new order to delivery
POST localhost:2000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "Luis Vazquez",
  "address": "Grazbachgasse 71",
  "orderValue": 22.22,
  "deliveryType": "EXPRESS"
}

### PUT REQUEST: Update type of an existent delivery
PUT http://localhost:2000/orders/3/delivery-type
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveryType": "CAR"
}

### GET REQUEST: send the message(result) when the delivery is done
GET http://localhost:2000/orders/4/delivery-info

### GET: Globale Einstellung liefert
GET localhost:2000/settings

### PUT: Ändert die globalen Einstellungen
PUT http://localhost:2000/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "volume": 80,
  "language": "EN",
  "difficult": "HARD"
}

###